OL,3,GNEWSANineteenth Century cap among
OL,4,Aprized possessions at first national
OL,5,Afootball museum
OL,6,
OL,7,FA museum showcasing the history of
OL,8,Ffootball in Wales is set to open to the
OL,9,Fpublic.
OL,11,FThe Football Museum of Wales and
OL,12,FWrexham Museum is the first of its
OL,13,Fkind, and will bring to life artefacts
OL,14,Fand memorabilia spanning 150 years of
OL,15,Fthe beautiful game in Wales.
OL,17,FFollowing a major redevelopment, part
OL,18,Fof the museum has also been designated
OL,19,Fto the history of Wrexham, showing how
OL,20,Fpeople lived and worked in the city
OL,21,Fover centuries.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
